0,1,,status,Jonathan,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
1,1,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
2,1,,status,Shion,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Kenji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Midori,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a pleasure to be here with you all. To ensure our choice is sustainable, I would like to examine this year's development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs by contact location.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. To avoid simply adding to a pile of forgotten initiatives, I shall examine the readmission figures during the call-back trial and the board minutes on a jointly run clinic.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Thank you, Jonathan and Shion. I am very happy to be part of this panel. I would like to look into the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover, as well as the therapy and midwifery staffing review.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to help pick a new program! I want to make sure we have enough space for everything, so I'll check the rooms, parking and shuttle coverage and what the booking system records!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a joy to be with you all. To make sure our new program has a strong and lasting foundation, I shall look into the data agreements with outside surgeries and the visit completion on the shared nursing round.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It seems we have a very comprehensive approach. By looking at the finances, the staffing, and the physical infrastructure, we can ensure our decision is grounded in reality. I look forward to seeing what we discover.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"Indeed. While the others focus on the current state of the house, I am more interested in the ghosts of our past failures. It would be a pity to repeat them in the name of progress.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,I agree with Shion. It is important to learn from the past so we can support our staff better. I hope the information we find helps us make a decision that brings harmony to the hospital.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"That's a great way to put it, Midori! I just don't want us to pick something awesome that then gets stuck because there's no place to park or no room to put it! I can't wait to see the data!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Your enthusiasm is wonderful, Kenji. It is so important that we all look after one another, from the patients to the staff. I believe our combined efforts will lead us to a very kind and sustainable choice.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree with Shizue. A kind approach, paired with a clear understanding of our resources, will allow us to choose a program that truly flourishes without creating future burdens.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Kindness is a pleasant sentiment, Jonathan, but it is rarely a metric for success. I suspect we will find that our previous ""kind"" initiatives were the ones most easily forgotten. Logic must lead the way.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I understand your point, Shion, but I believe logic and kindness can work together. If we understand the actual pressure our teams are under, we can make a logical choice that is also supportive.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I totally agree with Midori! If we're all happy and the hospital isn't too crowded, then the logic part will be way easier. I'm just really hoping the booking system isn't a total mess!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is a lovely thought, Midori. When we care for the people who do the caring, the whole hospital feels the warmth. Let us all be patient and open as we wait for our findings.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I believe we have found a balanced path for our investigation. I shall now step back and await the revelations of the records with a quiet heart. I wish you all clarity in your findings.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,"I find this level of optimism quite quaint. I shall also step back, though I expect the records to be far less cooperative than your spirits. I look forward to the results.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Midori,,I agree. I hope we can find a path that supports everyone involved. I look forward to hearing what you all discover in the next round.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm ready too! I'll be crossing my fingers that we have plenty of room for a great new program. See you all in the next round!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"It has been such a pleasure chatting with you all. I shall now go and see what the records tell us, keeping a hopeful heart for our future. Until we meet again, be well.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,1,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
